  "Preview Sounds before Import": "Preslušaj zvukove pre uvoza", "Curve points": "Tačke krive", "MP3 needs the FormMorpheus engine and its ffmpeg, and the engine is not answering.": "MP3 zahteva FormMorpheus motor i njegov ffmpeg, a motor ne odgovara.", "MP3 (engine ffmpeg)": "MP3 (ffmpeg motora)",
